Fresh timestamps trigger `MODIFIED` on unchanged reads. Could we omit unknown `Ready.updateTime` from get/list/watch responses?

```suggestion
// setReady sets the derived Ready condition. No condition update time is
// available from its source, so UpdateTime is left unset.
func setReady(task *v1alpha1.Task, condStatus, reason, message string) {
	for _, c := range task.Status.Conditions {
		if c.GetType() != v1alpha1.ConditionReady {
			continue
		}
		c.Status, c.Reason, c.Message = condStatus, reason, message
		c.UpdateTime = nil
		return
	}
	task.Status.Conditions = append(task.Status.Conditions, &v1alpha1.Condition{
		Type:    v1alpha1.ConditionReady,
		Status:  condStatus,
		Reason:  reason,
		Message: message,
	})
}
```

